        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/29b78afb7c475bf720892657dba9e69b.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/cf0169cac8370db692520ffefefaeedf.poster.avif?t=1764754596\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/cf0169cac8370db692520ffefefaeedf.webm?t=1764754596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/cf0169cac8370db692520ffefefaeedf.mp4?t=1764754596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Neffy -Moonlight Labyrinth X-</strong></i> is an action puzzle game where you team up with the young shrine maiden Neffy to solve riddles and overcome traps in a fantasy maze. <br>Originally developed for VR, the game has been carefully optimized for consoles—now more accessible than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/c00af320a56982212f7bc18afedeec35.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/8753e2d317bd2ba1964c41718350c4f6.avif?t=1764754596\" width=837 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you’ll switch between the “Novalis perspective” and the “Neffy perspective” as you progress through the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the “Novalis perspective” to activate heavy mechanisms or to transform Neffy into a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you need to explore hidden paths that are hard to see from Novalis’s viewpoint, switch to the “Neffy perspective” to discover new routes and delve deeper into the labyrinth.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/e1e8e2af35f340852c7fb2bf50f92887.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/8f3d21ba0bf0dba22c6554be702e7d55.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Novalis, a powerful summoned being who helps Neffy by manipulating gigantic mechanisms and unlocking sealed paths with the power of moonlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/b17d4f7d63f03ba5f0894345a2af1439.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact directly with Neffy to support her: transforming her into a cat, healing her, or triggering adorable reactions.<br>Neffy is fully voiced by Shiori Izawa (English version: Diana Garnet), adding warmth and personality to every encounter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 <strong>Connect with Neffy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/ec586fc338754f67c57842951b97261d.poster.avif?t=1764754596\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/ec586fc338754f67c57842951b97261d.webm?t=1764754596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/ec586fc338754f67c57842951b97261d.mp4?t=1764754596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform into a Black Cat</strong><br>Touch Neffy to help her become a cat—boosting her jump and agility!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/bbd8948dd657e97d84bfc327a3a446c8.poster.avif?t=1764754596\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/bbd8948dd657e97d84bfc327a3a446c8.webm?t=1764754596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/bbd8948dd657e97d84bfc327a3a446c8.mp4?t=1764754596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heal Her Wounds</strong><br>A gentle touch restores her strength and keeps her going.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/987a8a1dc34dbe5f47ca919c6f46e278.poster.avif?t=1764754596\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/987a8a1dc34dbe5f47ca919c6f46e278.webm?t=1764754596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/987a8a1dc34dbe5f47ca919c6f46e278.mp4?t=1764754596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Reactions</strong><br>Neffy responds with cute voice lines and animations when touched.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/40f394ba32cea070e13b674c9ac57774.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=191 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/0ea25da4c687afd53d603a8fbfa80ba8.avif?t=1764754596\" width=676 height=407 /></span>On touchscreen-supported devices, you can directly pet Neffy and interact with mechanisms for a more intuitive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/e5a091c82875e7a5038b4d924b07dd5f.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/29b78afb7c475bf720892657dba9e69b.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/cf0169cac8370db692520ffefefaeedf.poster.avif?t=1764754596\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/cf0169cac8370db692520ffefefaeedf.webm?t=1764754596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/cf0169cac8370db692520ffefefaeedf.mp4?t=1764754596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Neffy -Moonlight Labyrinth X-</strong></i> is an action puzzle game where you team up with the young shrine maiden Neffy to solve riddles and overcome traps in a fantasy maze. <br>Originally developed for VR, the game has been carefully optimized for consoles—now more accessible than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/c00af320a56982212f7bc18afedeec35.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/8753e2d317bd2ba1964c41718350c4f6.avif?t=1764754596\" width=837 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you’ll switch between the “Novalis perspective” and the “Neffy perspective” as you progress through the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the “Novalis perspective” to activate heavy mechanisms or to transform Neffy into a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you need to explore hidden paths that are hard to see from Novalis’s viewpoint, switch to the “Neffy perspective” to discover new routes and delve deeper into the labyrinth.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/e1e8e2af35f340852c7fb2bf50f92887.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/8f3d21ba0bf0dba22c6554be702e7d55.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Novalis, a powerful summoned being who helps Neffy by manipulating gigantic mechanisms and unlocking sealed paths with the power of moonlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/b17d4f7d63f03ba5f0894345a2af1439.avif?t=1764754596\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact directly with Neffy to support her: transforming her into a cat, healing her, or triggering adorable reactions.<br>Neffy is fully voiced by Shiori Izawa (English version: Diana Garnet), adding warmth and personality to every encounter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 <strong>Connect with Neffy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/ec586fc338754f67c57842951b97261d.poster.avif?t=1764754596\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/ec586fc338754f67